; final-response.ethos — the last message of a flow's turn, as one ethos type.
; Type root, proposed by the living 2026-09-19: the single object, then the
; vector of private type definitions needed to fill it. A Types root would be
; a vector of public types. Becomes a Signal when the nexus component that
; receives final responses exists.
; Open: on the wire a struct has no head, so the marked block FinalResponse.{ ... }
; needs the object to be a variant, e.g. Final.[ FinalResponse.{ ... } ]; the living rules.
Type
FinalResponse.{ FlowId Kind Markdown Vector<Topic> Vector<Subflow> Vector<Question> }
[ FlowId.String                                  ; the flow this response belongs to
  Kind.[ MainFlow Subflow ]                       ; marked as what it is
  Markdown.String                                 ; the report: structured Markdown with flowcharts
  Topic.String                                    ; a subject the flow is concerned with
  Subflow.{ Topic Markdown }                      ; a subflow the response implies: its topic and its brief
  Question.Markdown ]                             ; what needs a word from above
